.TH typst-completions 1  "typst-completions " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
typst\-completions \- Generates shell completion scripts
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtypst\-completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
